Triple7 has zero third-party runtime dependencies. Sound is synthesized at
runtime via the Web Audio API (no audio assets). Visual assets under
assets/sprites/ are optional, dev-time-generated art (see tools/genart/ and
Phase 31 of .claude/context/plan.md); every one of them has a hand-coded
canvas-painter fallback, and the game runs identically with assets/ deleted.
